      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PURE HAPPINESS (1) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from seven starts. Scored by a nose last time (17.66) in a Grade 5 over 324m at this track. Expected to go close. ZIPPING PALMER (7) can keep up the top recent form following a quick 17.67 win two back with a Grade 5 victory at this track over 324m in 17.73. Harder here but expected to feature again. BAGGY TROUSERS (4) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in five starts, including two wins and three placings. Recorded a 6 length win (20.69) in a Grade 5 last time at Nowra. Looks one of the chances. BAD BOY BANJO (2) hit the frame latest (17.74) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Has already won two times from this draw.",
